usage: module-nav session [-h] {save,load,list,note,export,delete} ...

positional arguments:
  {save,load,list,note,export,delete}
                        Session sub-commands
    save                Save current bookmarks + history + notes as a session
    load                Restore a saved session as active
    list                List all saved sessions
    note                Add a note to the active session
    export              Export session to file or stdout
    delete              Delete a saved session

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
